<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea to import 65 mln bbls of crude oil in July.</title>
<headline>S.Korea to import 65 mln bbls of crude oil in July.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean oil refiners plan to import 65 million barrels of crude oil this month against an estimated 64 million barrels imported last month, a Trade, Industry and Energy Ministry official said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The July imports compared with 60 million barrels imported in the same period of last year, he said.</p>
<p>The nation's total refining capacity stands at 2.44 million barrels per day.</p>
<p>South Korea, which produces no crude oil, depends entirely on imports.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
